The layout app/layouts/panorama.json is derived from Herdr app's shipped
layouts/main.json, installed on 2026-11-03. Changes replace the agents/spaces mod references with panorama and
panorama-spaces, set the sidebar width to 320 and the Spaces block to 143
logical pixels. B3 will make Spaces sizing follow its actual content.

