See LICENSE.herdr-app in this directory. No artwork is copied; the layout
continues to reference the app's own shipped mods and assets.

The sidebar adapts Herdr app's shipped agents/main.js patterns for priority
sections, row/fold/pin interactions, status marks, icons, age and native tree
lines; those derived portions retain the same Apache-2.0 attribution.
Original panorama feed/tree logic and installer code use the repository MIT
license. No shipped files are edited.

